Aurora's lib/metadata/spotify/spotify_auth.dart, spotify_models.dart and
spotify_metadata_provider.dart adapt the auth.ts, totp.ts, client.ts, mappers.ts,
index.ts and types.ts implementation to Dart. Modifications made 2026-10-12:
anonymous remote-secret rotation, bounded transport/cache/concurrency, explicit
pagination, sanitized errors, Aurora models, and injectable offline tests.
The remote secret dictionary is fetched from the same publicly referenced
source as upstream; no upstream encoded secrets are embedded in Aurora.

The adapted source remains available in Aurora's source distribution under
AGPL-3.0-only. Preserve this notice, LICENSE, and the corresponding source when
distributing the adapted provider. These files are included in Flutter assets.
No Nuclear or Spotify logo/artwork asset is copied from the plugin.
